WEBVTT

00:11:56.587 --> 00:12:00.758
I hope and believe that these learnings
from the game industry

00:12:00.799 --> 00:12:03.177
and from the metaverses
the communities created

00:12:03.177 --> 00:12:06.889
truly can help us all
make better metaverses in the future.

00:12:07.222 --> 00:12:11.643
A challenge for all of us
that will design and build metaverses

00:12:11.685 --> 00:12:16.482
is to ensure that we use them
for creativity,

00:12:16.523 --> 00:12:19.067
fun, inclusivity,

00:12:19.109 --> 00:12:22.988
and ultimately to build
a better real world.

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:24.198
Thank you so much.

00:12:24.239 --> 00:12:30.204
(Applause)